                new("What problem can newly hatched sea turtles face?", ["They cannot see the moon", "They hatch too early in the year", "They may crawl towards streetlights instead of the sea", "They are attacked by migrating birds"], 2, "The speaker says they \"may crawl inland towards streetlights instead of towards the sea\"."),
                new("Which solution does the speaker mention?", ["Shielding streetlights so they point downwards", "Building taller buildings", "Using brighter white lights", "Keeping all lights on through the night"], 0, "The speaker mentions \"shielding streetlights so they point downwards\" as a solution."),
